@startuml
title PayLink - Sequence Diagram 2: Refund a Failed Payment
autonumber

actor Customer
participant Biller
participant "Biller Adapter" as Adapter
participant "Payment Service" as Payment
participant "Wallet Service" as Wallet
participant Ledger
participant "Notification Service" as Notify
participant "SMS / Push Provider" as Provider

note over Payment,Wallet
  The payment has already reached SentToBiller.
  The payment amount is held in the customer's wallet.
end note

Biller -> Adapter : Send refusal response
Adapter -> Payment : Report payment failed

Payment -> Payment : Change state to Failed

Payment -> Wallet : Release held amount\n(paymentId, amount)
Wallet -> Wallet : Move amount from held\nto available balance

Wallet -> Ledger : Record hold release
Ledger --> Wallet : Entry recorded

Wallet --> Payment : Release successful

Payment -> Payment : Change state to Refunded

Payment -> Notify : Send failed payment notification
Notify -> Provider : Send SMS and push notification
Provider --> Notify : Delivery result
Provider -> Customer : Deliver failed payment notification
@enduml